        "sid": "2CO 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as touching the ministering to the saints, it is superfluous for me to write to you: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for I know your readiness, of which I glory on your behalf to them of Macedonia, that Achaia hath been prepared for a year past; and your zeal hath stirred up very many of them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I have sent the brethren, that our glorying on your behalf may not be made void in this respect; that, even as I said, ye may be prepared: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lest by any means, if there come with me any of Macedonia and find you unprepared, we (that we say not, ye) should be put to shame in this confidence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thought it necessary therefore to entreat the brethren, that they would go before unto you, and make up beforehand your aforepromised bounty, that the same might be ready as a matter of bounty, and not of extortion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But this ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", He that soweth sparingly shall reap also sparingly; and he that soweth bountifully shall reap also bountifully. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " each man ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " according as he hath purposed in his heart: not grudgingly, or of necessity: for God loveth a cheerful giver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God is able to make all grace abound unto you; that ye, having always all sufficiency in everything, may abound unto every good work: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as it is written,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
